<h1>About Us</h1>
<h2>Who We Are</h2>
<p>R&amp;D Tax Solutions was established in 2002 by President, Greg Meimar, to provide companies with assistance in preparing their SR&amp;ED tax credit claims. Greg is a Mechanical Engineering Graduate and a Deloitte alumnus. With over 20 years of industry experience and an involvement in so many claims, our practice is a good choice for providing support with your company’s next claim.</p>
<p>With the business growing and a need to connect with clients across Canada, Theo Meimar joined the practice in 2010 as our Vice President. Theo is a Mechanical Engineer with an extensive processing background.</p>
<p>Together, and with our team of industry experts, we are positioned to handle your claims from start to finish. Our approach takes the burden from your valuable employees and puts it in our hands; thereby, leaving your team to work at what they are hired to do.</p>
<p>With hundreds of successful SR&amp;ED claims made in a variety of different industries, there is no better choice than R&amp;D Tax Solutions for your next SR&amp;ED claim. We value our client relationships as well as the reputation that we have with CRA. We work closely with CRA SR&amp;ED employees on your claims. We have been told, time and time again, that, it is refreshing to work with a Consultant that understands the work and can be relied on year after year to make high quality claims.</p>
